Package: lcNEPSE
Title: Reproducible Access to Nepalese Stock Market Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Koshish Jung", "Lamichhane",
           email = "Koshishl.c@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-5455-5741"))
Description: Provides reproducible, automated access to daily share prices and
    sector indices from Nepal's secondary market as published by ShareSansar.
    A scheduled GitHub Actions workflow scrapes the published tables, preserves
    a dated archive with content hashes, validates every partition, and
    publishes it to a GitHub data branch. The package retrieves only
    hash-verified partition files, standardizes them into tidy data, and keeps
    the original source URL and archive vintage attached to every observation.
    This independent package is not affiliated with or endorsed by ShareSansar
    or the Nepal Stock Exchange.
